    "summary": "Your Shooting Phase. Choose a THOUSAND SONS PSYKER unit of yours wholly in your Flow of Magic that has yet to be picked to shoot. For the phase, its models gain [IGNORES COVER] on their ranged weapons. Once they finish attacking, pick one enemy unit they hit with those attacks. That enemy unit cannot receive the Benefit of Cover during the rest of this phase.",
